# Curated "agent-common" libraries — direct requirements (editable source).
#
# These libraries are pre-installed in the runtime image so a sandbox claimed
# from the warm pool is immediately productive (no first-call install). This
# file lists only the direct dependencies, pinned to exact versions; the
# fully-resolved lock (all transitives + hashes), which is what actually gets
# installed, is generated into requirements-common.txt.
#
# Regenerate the lock after editing this file:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes requirements-common.in -o requirements-common.txt

